    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Watch out for sound-based exceptions like 'a university' (consonant sound) vs 'an honest man' (vowel sound), which are heavily tested in SSC.",
        "Distinguish between primary purpose (Zero Article) and secondary purpose ('The') for locations like school, college, hospital, and prison.",
        "Do not use articles with abstract or uncountable nouns unless they are modified or restricted to a specific context."
      ],
